  - "radiomics"
  - "machine learning"
  - "full-reference IQA"
  - "reproducibility"
abstract: >-
  Software and derived analysis workflow for full-reference ultrasound image
  quality assessment using radiomic representations and reference-grouped
  nested model development. The repository supports exact reproduction of the
  paper modeling results from released derived inputs and reuse of the same
  workflow with user-supplied ultrasound images and subjective targets.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "A Radiomics-Based Machine Learning Framework for Full-Reference Ultrasound Image Quality Assessment Across Varying Acquisition Settings"
